  "segments": [
    {
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 5700,
      "text": "Activity 3. Listen to the interview and complete the notes."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 7120,
      "end_ms": 16560,
      "text": "Mr Ouyang Hong Hong, welcome to our programme. You worked with Bingjia for years. Do you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 16560,
      "end_ms": 18600,
      "text": "remember your first meeting?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 18600,
      "end_ms": 30660,
      "text": "Yes, I first met Bingjie in 2007. He just ran up to me to say hello. Then we became best"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 30660,
      "end_ms": 31160,
      "text": "friends."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 31980,
      "end_ms": 41240,
      "text": "That's lovely. I am sure you had a lot of happy times together. Well, Bingjie is most"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 41240,
      "end_ms": 47720,
      "text": "famous for his rescue work in Wenchuan. Can you tell us something about that?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 48700,
      "end_ms": 58040,
      "text": "Bingjie worked very hard. He got hurt but he didn't stop. On the second day he found"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 58040,
      "end_ms": 63600,
      "text": "a six year old girl. She was the first person our team found."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 64540,
      "end_ms": 70100,
      "text": "Bingjie is a real hero. What do you want to say to him now?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 70940,
      "end_ms": 79580,
      "text": "Bingjie, I want to hug you again. I miss you so much. You are always my friend."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 80340,
      "end_ms": 84940,
      "text": "We all miss him. Thank you for sharing, Mr Ouyang."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 93700,
      "end_ms": 99440,
      "text": "Listen again. Then talk about how the host asked questions."
